ri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> million for continuing operations and </span><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_RevenuePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_us-gaap_StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis_us-gaap_SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_Jdy7_oqzpEipwyqVf70DrQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationInterestExpense" scale="6" id="Narr_NLymP8M4q0aefBXyhfZUiw">0.2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> million for discontinued operations related to UDENYCA. For the six months ended June 30, 2025, interest expense was </span><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_RevenuePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_us-gaap_StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_UplTIZ4llUCLGjaq9XgBtg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:InterestExpenseInclusiveOfAmortizationOfDiscountAndIssuanceCostsOnRevenueParticipationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_oG11gAUTpEymcWzqXEUqbA">1.9</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> million for continuing operations and </span><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_RevenuePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_us-gaap_StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis_us-gaap_SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_Ivl337-bnkezwUnecGURsg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationInterestExpense" scale="6" id="Narr_XRPDBc7nv0Oh_Xfn-uDbaA">1.9</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#160;million for discontinued operations . &#160;</span></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_KvWFLqLvJ0ylgVmvHJyZKQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_RWCgkbdK3U2qYTeSdZgwCA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_VIiGH_a9n0SdKC8nTl5Vkg">1.5</ix:nonFraction>%</b><b style="font-weight:bold;"> Convertible Senior Subordinated Notes due 2026 </b></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:24.5pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In April 2020, the Company issued and sold $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_RWCgkbdK3U2qYTeSdZgwCA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_omLgkVVwRkqNfpbWd_K-og">230.0</ix:nonFraction> million aggregate principal amount of its <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_KvWFLqLvJ0ylgVmvHJyZKQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_RWCgkbdK3U2qYTeSdZgwCA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_0A60SkWEm0mCLBcFFqguVQ">1.5</ix:nonFraction>% Convertible Senior Subordinated Notes due 2026 (the &#8220;2026 Convertible Notes&#8221;). <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2020_To_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_9mF17FrOQkag0-z3WBCOpA" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateTerms" id="Narr_cgHJQIVCjUag81Uy7O0d6Q">The 2026 Convertible Notes accrued interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_KvWFLqLvJ0ylgVmvHJyZKQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_RWCgkbdK3U2qYTeSdZgwCA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_y7XeD4Nl2USag-iU436mJg">1.5</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable semi-annually in arrears on April 15 and October 15 of each year</ix:nonNumeric> and matured on <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2020_To_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_9mF17FrOQkag0-z3WBCOpA" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate" id="Narr_7DFlVfTSIU2eNXVuMKqr5Q">April 15, 2026</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:24.5pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 15, 2025, the Company paid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="Duration_4_15_2025_To_4_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_DTttpHcC4UquUuqGZzA00A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfConvertibleDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_j7MS9RaYNU6ly0nekdKIxw">170.0</ix:nonFraction> million in cash to repurchase $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="As_Of_4_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_qyNzg5sBEEiGRFjQT75C9g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRepurchaseAmount" scale="6" id="Narr__vno6_r5qES_MDvLU93mtw">170.0</ix:nonFraction> million aggregate principal amount of the 2026 Convertible Notes in privately negotiated transactions. On May 15, 2025, pursuant to the Fundamental Change Repurchase Right (as defined in the indenture, dated as of April 17, 2020, between the Company and U.S. Bank Trust Company, National Association, as trustee), the Company repurchased $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2025_To_5_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_md_djf3RikO47HdENUZ3Kg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ExtinguishmentOfDebtAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_3auh7UI4sUaTI7vLY-ajNw">59.9</ix:nonFraction> million aggregate principal amount of the 2026 Convertible Notes, at a cash repurchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="As_Of_5_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_o1yFIkYijki8fpv4MlIrmg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRepurchaseAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_8IKQx77Wp0KLVJa4MFG4bQ">59.9</ix:nonFraction> million, which amount was equivalent to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_KvWFLqLvJ0ylgVmvHJyZKQ" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2025_To_5_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_md_djf3RikO47HdENUZ3Kg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRedemptionPricePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_TuwhsiYaEUq7-xLoSmmA3g">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the principal amount of the repurchased notes, together with the accrued and unpaid interest. In connection with the repurchases, the Company recorded a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_Jz2lYSC_vEyYnnySofsc6g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationGainLossOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" sign="-" scale="6" id="Narr_FaID9piC80-1LBbfsKIoXw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_tdqOe_f5-0CXD_azrlCFUA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_S5ZKbvekSUabx47Cj9BKdw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationGainLossOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" sign="-" scale="6" id="Narr_dodHlAWh10C5grgSW5gSwg">4.7</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> million loss on debt extinguishment which is classified within discontinued operations in the condensed consolidated statements of operations for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025. The charge included the write-off of the remaining debt discount and debt issuance costs and related transaction fees. The 2026 Convertible Notes were fully repaid in April 2026 at maturity. </p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:24.5pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The annual effective interest rate was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_KvWFLqLvJ0ylgVmvHJyZKQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_JSg7L07GE0KohFrVHXt0ow" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_AGZyY3JtE02dH2ystqlWzA">2.1</ix:nonFraction>% for the 2026 Convertible Notes, and the following table presents the components of interest expense which have been presented within discontinued operations:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_4TEnQQTtV0WwUjqTo0xkwQ" name="us-gaap:InterestIncomeAndInterestExpenseDisclosureTableTextBlock" id="Tb_AA1SgUsDD0O8qrxJTkxlTA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:52.3%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.1%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri'